material bends and folds.\n\n**Setting & Background:**\nThe background suggests a sunny day on a coastal urban street. Behind her are blurred city buildings, likely skyscrapers, bathed in daylight. To the far right, beyond a railing (partially visible), lies a vast expanse of blue ocean with gentle waves breaking near shore. The sky above is clear and brilliant white-blue, indicating midday sun.\n\nThe photograph employs shallow depth of field, rendering the subject sharply while softly blurring both the foreground sidewalk and distant scenery—a technique used effectively for portraiture to emphasize the model's presence against the scenic backdrop.\n\nOverall impression: This image evokes themes of youthful elegance, contemporary style, and effortless grace set within a vibrant seaside metropolis. There is a strong contrast between the organic flow of her hair and clothing and the sleek, synthetic texture of the metallic element, making it visually arresting and highly stylized."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 18, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 15, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 9}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [-207.95104099507444, -488.0478882060553], "scale": 1.5535220464769084}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "Group", "bounding": [377, 266.3999938964844, 1640.7305908203125, 734.3209228515625]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "Group", "bounding": [-567.0575561523438, 226.12803649902344, 878.3566284179688, 798.354736328125]}], "links": [[1, 2, 0, 3, 0, "CLIP"], [2, 2, 0, 4, 0, "CLIP"], [3, 3, 0, 5, 1, "CONDITIONING"], [4, 4, 0, 5, 2, "CONDITIONING"], [5, 1, 0, 5, 0, "MODEL"], [7, 5, 0, 7, 0, "LATENT"], [8, 8, 0, 7, 1, "VAE"], [10, 10, 0, 5, 3, "LA